  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/61fe10bd-d101-48cc-b9df-2bb54fd6ac7d-image.png\" style=\"width: 325px; height: 154px;\" /></p><p>Heat Loss is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;initial voltage of capacitor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the initial voltage of capacitor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msubs